Key Requirements & User Directives
Brand Identity & Color Palette:

Inspired directly by nutrigo-logo.jpg: Deep Forest Green (#0F4A2B), Vibrant Leaf Green (#16A34A / #22C55E), Fresh Lime (#84CC16), Clean Mint (#F0FDF4), and warm energetic accents.
Interactive, animated landing page with premium design aesthetics (glassmorphism, micro-animations, interactive calorie/meal calculator).
Multi-Role System & Workflows:

Super Admin:
Approves/declines Healthy Store registrations (strict healthy vetting).
Approves/declines Delivery Rider applications.
Manages partner content creators/vloggers, supplement brands, and subscriptions.
Platform analytics, commission rates, delivery fee settings.
Healthy Store Portal:
Register store with Lipa City barangay, business permit/health certification, GCash QR & account details.
Manage menu items with Nutrition Information (Calories, Protein, Carbs, Fats), Healthy Choice Badges, dietary tags (Vegan, Keto, Diabetic-friendly, Gluten-free, High-protein, Low-carb), and Healthy Alternative Recommendations.
Receive orders with Manual GCash Payment Verification (view uploaded screenshot & reference number) or COD.
One-click Accept / Decline with reason -> Update order status to "Preparing" -> "Ready for Pickup".
Delivery Rider Portal & In-App Wallet Payout System:
Register with vehicle type, plate number, driver's license.
Browse available Lipa City delivery requests ready for pickup.
Active Order Limit: Maximum 3 active orders per rider per trip (Rider cannot accept a 4th order until one of the current 3 is marked 'Delivered' to ensure fast, fresh delivery).
Accept delivery -> Navigate/View customer & store details in Lipa -> Mark "Picked Up" -> "On The Way" -> "Delivered" with delivery photo proof.
In-App Rider Wallet & Automated Payout Engine:
When order is marked Delivered, the Delivery Fee (Base Fare + Distance Gas Allowance) is instantly credited to the Rider's NutriGo Wallet.
Rider dashboard displays Today's Earnings, Total Wallet Balance, and Trip History Ledger.
GCash Payout Module: Rider can request a GCash cashout (Daily/Weekly) -> Super Admin reviews in Admin Payouts Queue, sends GCash, enters reference #, and marks completed.
Accurate Distance & Fuel-Based Delivery Fee Engine (Grab / Foodpanda / Angkas Standard):
Point-to-Point Distance Matrix: Every Lipa City Barangay and Store has pre-mapped geolocation coordinates (Lat/Long).
Instant Transparent Fee Formula:
Base Delivery Fare (first 1.5 km): e.g. ₱40.00 (covers booking & initial dispatch).
Per Kilometer Gas & Travel Rate: e.g. ₱10.00 / km beyond 1.5 km.
Formula: Fee = Base Fare + max(0, Distance_km - 1.5) * Rate_per_km
Instant Real-Time Calculation: As soon as the customer picks their Lipa barangay or store, the exact distance (e.g. 3.2 km), estimated travel time (e.g. 14 mins), and exact fixed delivery fee (e.g. ₱57) are immediately calculated and shown—no confusing estimates or vague ranges!
Admin Configurable: Base fare, base km, and rate per km can be adjusted anytime in the Super Admin Settings.
User / Customer Experience & Interactive Map Suite:
Interactive Checkout Map Pinning (Lipa City):
Interactive Leaflet/OpenStreetMap centered on Lipa City.
Customer drops pin or searches address -> Automatically captures exact latitude & longitude.
Dedicated fields for Lipa Barangay, Street/House No., and Delivery Landmark & Rider Notes (e.g., "Beside green gate, in front of sari-sari store, doorbell 2x").
Real-Time Live Map Order Tracking:
Live Map view showing Store Pin (Green), Customer Pin (Orange/Target), and Live Animated Moving Rider Icon (Motorcycle with pulse).
Route Polyline: Clear visible route line drawn connecting Store to Customer location.
Dynamic Live ETA: Continuously calculating and updating estimated arrival time (e.g., "Arriving in 8 mins").
Live status step tracker (Store Preparing -> Rider Picked Up -> On The Way -> Arrived -> Delivered).
Rider Navigation Map:
Rider view with exact turn-by-turn route path, exact Lat/Long coordinates, distance, customer landmark, and one-click Waze/Google Maps integration.
Content Creators, Vlogger Partnerships & Meal Prep Subscriptions:
Creator Vlogs & Cooking Hub: Watch partner health vloggers cook nutritious meals with direct "Order Ingredients" links to partner stores.
Supplements Corner: Dedicated verified vendors for organic supplements, whey protein, herbal vitamins, superfoods.
NutriGo VIP Subscription: Premium access tier for exclusive meal prep guides, custom calorie calculator, vlogger masterclasses, and delivery discounts.